SUMMARY:[POPL 2026] Volunteer Application Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Applicants can be undergraduate\, Master's\, Ph.D. full- or pa
 rt-time students from computer science or related fields. They receive a 
 complimentary conference registration\, free lunches/refreshments\, and v
 olunteer garments in exchange for approximately 18 hours of work covering
  four days at the conference. To apply\, fill out the provided form befor
 e November 10th\, 2025.\n\nSource: https://popl26.sigplan.org/track/POPL-
 2026-student-volunteers
END:VEVENT
