SUMMARY:[CAV 2026] Paper Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Papers can include a clearly marked appendix\, however\, the r
 eviewers are not obliged to read the contents of these appendices. All pa
 ge limits do not include references and appendices. Papers in all four ca
 tegories must be submitted by January 28\, 2026 AoE\, and should be in LN
 CS format. Note Springer's guidelines regarding AI Authorship. Simultaneo
 us submission to other conferences with proceedings or submission of mate
 rial that has already been published elsewhere is not allowed.\n\nSource:
  http://conferences.i-cav.org/2026/cfp/
END:VEVENT
