SUMMARY:[ICFP 2026] Paper Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Submissions must be in PDF format\, printable in black and whi
 te on US Letter sized paper and interpretable by common PDF tools. All su
 bmissions must adhere to the "ACM Small" template. There is a limit of 25
  pages for a full paper or Functional Pearl and 12 pages for an Experienc
 e Report\; the bibliography and an optional clearly marked appendix will 
 not be counted against these limits. Submissions that exceed the page lim
 its or do not meet formatting requirements will be desk rejected. The con
 ference uses a full double-blind reviewing process where author identitie
 s are omitted from submissions. Authors may submit improved versions befo
 re the deadline. Authors of conditionally accepted papers must provide re
 vised submissions by 3 June 2026 accompanied by a cover letter mapping ea
 ch mandatory revision request to specific parts of the paper.\n\nSource: 
 https://icfp26.sigplan.org/track/icfp-2026-icfp-papers\nMaintenance: E003
  - see https://github.com/JonasAlaif/pl-conferences/blob/main/MAINTENANCE
 .md
END:VEVENT
