SUMMARY:[PLDI 2026] Volunteer Application Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Undergraduate\, Master's\, Ph.D.\, full- or part-time students
  (current or prospective) of computer science and related fields can appl
 y. Volunteers receive complimentary registration to PLDI but do not get t
 ravel expenses covered. Spots are limited\, and selection involves coordi
 nation with Video Chairs for video volunteers and a lottery-based system 
 for general volunteers. Applications should be submitted via the provided
  form.\n\nSource: https://pldi26.sigplan.org/track/pldi-2026-student-volu
 nteering
