SUMMARY:[ETAPS 2027 (ESOP)] R1 Paper Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:The four main conferences of ETAPS 2027 solicit contributions.
  ESOP accepts regular research papers (max 25 pp)\, experience reports (m
 ax 15 pp)\, and fresh perspectives (max 15 pp). iFS accepts long (16pp + 
 2pp refs) or short (8pp + 1pp refs) papers for specific categories. FoSSa
 CS accepts regular research papers (max 18 pp). TACAS accepts regular res
 earch\, case study\, and tool papers (max 18 pp)\, plus tool demonstratio
 n papers (max 6 pp). All page limits exclude the bibliography. Submission
 s must be in English\, original\, unpublished\, and not submitted elsewhe
 re. Simultaneous submission is forbidden. Formatting must follow Springer
 's LNCS guidelines (llncs.cls) except for ESOP. Double-blind reviewing is
  used for TACAS and iFS regular research papers\; authors must omit names
 /institutions. Data availability statements are mandatory. Artifact evalu
 ation is voluntary for most tracks but required for tool papers at TACAS.
  Authors must attend the conference to present their paper.\n\nSubmit at:
  https://etaps.org/2027/esop\n\nSource: https://etaps.org/2027/cfp/
END:VEVENT
