SUMMARY:[ICFP 2026] Volunteer Application Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Students and Programming Languages researchers from around the
  world are welcome to apply. Priority is given to junior members\, such a
 s full- or part-time computer science students. Volunteers receive a comp
 limentary conference registration\, free lunches and refreshments\, a vol
 unteer shirt\, and free admission to social events\, though they must arr
 ange their own travel and accommodation. To apply\, visit the provided li
 nk.\n\nSource: https://icfp26.sigplan.org/track/icfp-2026-icfp-volunteers
END:VEVENT
