SUMMARY:[SPLASH 2026 (OOPSLA)] Volunteer Application Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Students and researchers from computer science and related fie
 lds are welcome to apply. Volunteers receive a complimentary conference r
 egistration (including access to all sessions and proceedings)\, free lun
 ches\, refreshments\, a volunteer shirt\, and free admission to social ev
 ents. To apply\, send an email to thalakottur.m@northeastern.edu\, robert
 .zhang@utexas.edu\, or hnzhu@ucdavis.edu.\n\nSource: https://2026.splashc
 on.org/track/splash-issta-2026-student-volunteers
END:VEVENT
