DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261106
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261107
SUMMARY:[SPLASH 2027 (OOPSLA)] Volunteer Application Deadline
DESCRIPTION:College students can apply to volunteer for Splash! at Cornell
 . Volunteers help with program setup\, registration\, lunch\, and clean-u
 p. They receive free lunch and a t-shirt. Service hours can be provided. 
 To moderate classes\, volunteers must email the organizers to state their
  preference and complete additional forms including a background check.\n
 \nApply at: https://cornell.learningu.org/volunteer/Splash/current/signup
 \n\nSource: https://cornell.learningu.org/volunteer.html
END:VEVENT
