SUMMARY:[SPLASH 2027 (OOPSLA)] R2 Paper Submission Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Papers must be submitted using HotCRP. Initial submissions mus
 t be at most 23 pages\; revisions and camera-ready papers can go up to 25
  pages plus references and data-availability/funding/acknowledgments sect
 ions. At least one senior author must register as a reserve reviewer unle
 ss exempt. Papers rejected in Round 1 cannot be resubmitted in Round 2\, 
 but papers rejected from OOPSLA 2026 are welcome. Authors must maintain a
 nonymity until acceptance or rejection.\n\nSubmit at: https://oopsla27.ho
 tcrp.com/\n\nSource: https://conf.researchr.org/track/splash-2027/splasho
 opsla2027
END:VEVENT
